[8.881912, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r--- RUNBOOK ---\r\n"]
[8.885693, "o", "# WBILL job step - run notes\r\n\r\nWBILL prints the quarterly water statements for one district, then posts the\r\nquarter's payments and adjustments against the new balances and prints the\r\nledger. It is the second step of the quarterly run, after the meter-reading\r\nextract and the payments export.\r\n\r\n## Build\r\n\r\n    cobc -x WBILL.cbl\r\n\r\nGnuCOBOL 3.1.2, default dialect and options. The copybooks `CUSTREC.cpy` and\r\n`TARIFFS.cpy` sit next to the program.\r\n\r\n## Run\r\n\r\n    CUSTIN=<reading extract> PAYIN=<payments export> STMTOUT=<statement file> ./WBILL\r\n\r\n- `CUSTIN` is a line sequential file of 80-byte records laid out as in\r\n  `CUSTREC.cpy`: normally one `H` header record, then one `C` record per\r\n  account. A line shorter than 80 bytes is read as if padded on the right with\r\n  spaces (an empty line as 80 spaces), but a `C` record always runs at least\r\n  through `PAID` (64 bytes) and an `H` record through `STMT-DATE`. Numeric\r\n  fields always hold digits, with a `+` or `-` in front where the layout has a\r\n  separat"]
[8.885716, "o", "e sign. A district's current charges stay below 1,000,000.00 per\r\n  account and below 100,000,000.00 in total.\r\n- `PAYIN` is a line sequential file of lines up to 80 bytes, one posting per\r\n  line, with fields separated by `;` as the program's `UNSTRING` expects. It\r\n  is keyed by hand at the counters and by the bank feed, so any printable\r\n  ASCII can turn up in it. A line shorter than 80 bytes is read as if padded\r\n  on the right with spaces (an empty line as 80 spaces). An empty file means\r\n  nothing to post. Every posting, once rounded to cents, is at most 99,999.99\r\n  either way, and a run's postings total less than 10,000,000.00 either way.\r\n- An amount passes the program's `TEST-NUMVAL` check when it is spaces, an\r\n  optional `+` or `-` and more spaces, then digits with at most one decimal\r\n  point (`.5` and `5.` included), then spaces; or spaces, digits with at most\r\n  one decimal point, spaces, and an optional trailing `+`, `-`, `CR` or `DB` in\r\n  capitals, then spaces. Anything else, a blank amount "]
[8.885726, "o", "included, is refused.\r\n- Both inputs are printable ASCII with line-feed line ends.\r\n- `STMTOUT` is a line sequential file: every record the program writes goes\r\n  out with its trailing spaces removed and a single line feed after it.\r\n\r\n## Samples\r\n\r\n`samples/2025q1-north.dat` is the Q1 2025 reading extract for the north\r\ndistrict, `samples/2025q1-north.pay` its payments export, and\r\n`samples/2025q1-north.stmt` the statement file this step produced from them.\r\nPrinting and posting take `STMTOUT` as it stands, so its exact bytes matter.\r\n"]
[8.885804, "o", "--- WBILL ---\r\n"]
[8.886481, "o", "     1\t       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\r\n"]
[8.886826, "o", "     2\t       PROGRAM-ID. WBILL.\r\n     3\t      *----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n     4\t      * WBILL - QUARTERLY WATER STATEMENT RUN.\r\n     5\t      * READS THE METER-READING FILE (CUSTIN) AND WRITES THE PRINTED\r\n     6\t      * STATEMENT FILE (STMTOUT).  ONE HEADER RECORD, THEN ONE RECORD\r\n     7\t      * PER ACCOUNT.  THEN POSTS THE PAYMENTS AND ADJUSTMENTS FILE\r\n     8\t      * (PAYIN) AGAINST THE NEW BALANCES AND PRINTS THE LEDGER.\r\n     9\t      *----------------------------------------------------------------\r\n    10\t       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.\r\n    11\t       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.\r\n    12\t       FILE-CONTROL.\r\n    13\t           SELECT CUST-IN  ASSIGN TO CUSTIN\r\n    14\t               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.\r\n    15\t           SELECT STMT-OUT ASSIGN TO STMTOUT\r\n    16\t               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.\r\n    17\t           SELECT PAY-IN   ASSIGN TO PAYIN\r\n    18\t               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.\r\n    19\t       DATA DIVISION.\r\n    20\t       FI"]
[8.886854, "o", "LE SECTION.\r\n    21\t       FD  CUST-IN.\r\n    22\t       01  IN-REC                    PIC X(80).\r\n    23\t       FD  STMT-OUT.\r\n    24\t       01  OUT-REC                   PIC X(72).\r\n    25\t       FD  PAY-IN.\r\n    26\t       01  PAY-REC                   PIC X(80).\r\n    27\t       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\r\n    28\t       COPY \"CUSTREC.cpy\".\r\n    29\t       COPY \"TARIFFS.cpy\".\r\n    30\t       01  WS-FLAGS.\r\n    31\t           05  WS-EOF                PIC X VALUE \"N\".\r\n    32\t               88  END-OF-INPUT      VALUE \"Y\".\r\n    33\t           05  WS-PAY-EOF            PIC X VALUE \"N\".\r\n    34\t               88  END-OF-PAY        VALUE \"Y\".\r\n    35\t       01  ACCT-TABLE.\r\n    36\t           05  AT-COUNT              PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.\r\n    37\t           05  AT-ENTRY OCCURS 1 TO 999 TIMES\r\n    38\t                   DEPENDING ON AT-COUNT INDEXED BY AX.\r\n    39\t               10  AT-ACCT           PIC X(8).\r\n    40\t               10  AT-BAL            PIC S9(9)V99.\r\n    41\t       01  PAY-WORK.\r\n    42\t           05  PAY-LIN"]
[8.886865, "o", "E              PIC X(80).\r\n    43\t           05  PL-ACCT               PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.\r\n    44\t           05  PL-KIND               PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.\r\n    45\t               88  KIND-PAY          VALUE \"PAY\".\r\n    46\t               88  KIND-ADJ          VALUE \"ADJ\".\r\n    47\t               88  KIND-FEE          VALUE \"FEE\".\r\n    48\t               88  KIND-REF          VALUE \"REF\".\r\n    49\t           05  PL-AMT-TXT            PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.\r\n    50\t           05  PL-MEMO               PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.\r\n    51\t           05  PL-FIELDS             PIC 99.\r\n    52\t           05  PL-ACCT-LEN           PIC 99.\r\n    53\t           05  WS-LINE-NO            PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.\r\n    54\t           05  WS-AMT                PIC S9(7)V99.\r\n    55\t           05  WS-WHOLE              PIC S9(7).\r\n    56\t           05  WS-PART               PIC S9(7)V99.\r\n    57\t           05  WS-REM                PIC S9(3)V99.\r\n    58\t           05  WS-APPLIED            PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.\r\n    59\t           05  "]
[8.886874, "o", "WS-PAY-REJECTED       PIC 9(3)  VALUE 0.\r\n    60\t           05  WS-TOT-PAID           PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    61\t           05  WS-TOT-OTHER          PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    62\t       01  WS-WORK.\r\n    63\t           05  WS-UNITS              PIC 9(7).\r\n    64\t           05  WS-TEMP               PIC 9(7).\r\n    65\t           05  WS-LIM1               PIC 9(5)V9.\r\n    66\t           05  WS-LIM2               PIC 9(5)V9.\r\n    67\t           05  WS-B1                 PIC 9(5)V9.\r\n    68\t           05  WS-B2                 PIC 9(5)V9.\r\n    69\t           05  WS-B3                 PIC 9(7)V9.\r\n    70\t           05  WS-C1                 PIC 9(6)V99.\r\n    71\t           05  WS-C2                 PIC 9(6)V99.\r\n    72\t           05  WS-C3                 PIC 9(7)V99.\r\n    73\t           05  WS-USAGE              PIC 9(7)V99.\r\n    74\t           05  WS-STANDING           PIC 9(5)V99.\r\n    75\t           05  WS-DISCOUNT           PIC 9(6)V99.\r\n    76\t           05  WS-NET                PIC 9(7)V99.\r\n    77\t           0"]
[8.886953, "o", "5  WS-VAT                PIC 9(6)V99.\r\n    78\t           05  WS-CURRENT            PIC 9(7)V99.\r\n    79\t           05  WS-INTEREST           PIC 9(5)V99.\r\n    80\t           05  WS-BALANCE            PIC S9(7)V99.\r\n    81\t           05  WS-CARRY              PIC S9(7)V99.\r\n    82\t           05  WS-DUE                PIC 9(7)V99.\r\n    83\t           05  WS-NAME               PIC X(24).\r\n    84\t           05  WS-NAME-OUT           PIC X(24).\r\n    85\t           05  WS-REASON             PIC X(20).\r\n    86\t           05  WS-DATE-DMY           PIC 9(8).\r\n    87\t       01  WS-TOTALS.\r\n    88\t           05  WS-BILLED             PIC 9(3)    VALUE 0.\r\n    89\t           05  WS-REJECTED           PIC 9(3)    VALUE 0.\r\n    90\t           05  WS-CREDITS            PIC 9(3)    VALUE 0.\r\n    91\t           05  WS-TOT-UNITS          PIC 9(11)   VALUE 0.\r\n    92\t           05  WS-TOT-CURRENT        PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    93\t           05  WS-TOT-DUE            PIC 9(11)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    94\t           05  WS-TOT-NET          "]
[8.886962, "o", "  PIC S9(11)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    95\t           05  WS-AVERAGE            PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.\r\n    96\t       01  L-HEAD.\r\n    97\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(15) VALUE \"STATEMENTS FOR \".\r\n    98\t           05  LH-REGION             PIC X(20).\r\n    99\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(7)  VALUE \" DATED \".\r\n   100\t           05  LH-DATE               PIC 99/99/9999.\r\n   101\t       01  L-ACCT.\r\n   102\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"ACCOUNT \".\r\n   103\t           05  LA-MASK               PIC X(4)  VALUE \"****\".\r\n   104\t           05  LA-TAIL               PIC X(4).\r\n   105\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.\r\n   106\t           05  LA-NAME               PIC X(24).\r\n   107\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \" TARIFF \".\r\n   108\t           05  LA-TARIFF             PIC X.\r\n   109\t       01  L-READ.\r\n   110\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(9)  VALUE \"READINGS \".\r\n   111\t           05  LR-PREV               PIC ZZZZZ9.\r\n   1"]
[8.886973, "o", "12\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(4)  VALUE \" TO \".\r\n   113\t           05  LR-CURR               PIC ZZZZZ9.\r\n   114\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"  USAGE \".\r\n   115\t           05  LR-UNITS              PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.\r\n   116\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(6)  VALUE \" OVER \".\r\n   117\t           05  LR-DAYS               PIC ZZ9.\r\n   118\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(5)  VALUE \" DAYS\".\r\n   119\t       01  L-BANDS.\r\n   120\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(6)  VALUE \"BANDS \".\r\n   121\t           05  LB-1                  PIC ZZ,ZZ9.9.\r\n   122\t           05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   123\t           05  LB-2                  PIC ZZ,ZZ9.9.\r\n   124\t           05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   125\t           05  LB-3                  PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.9.\r\n   126\t       01  L-CHARGE.\r\n   127\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(13) VALUE \"USAGE CHARGE \".\r\n   128\t           05  LC-USAGE              PIC $$,$"]
[8.886982, "o", "$$,$$9.99.\r\n   129\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE \"  STANDING\".\r\n   130\t           05  LC-STANDING           PIC $$$,$$9.99.\r\n   131\t       01  L-DISC.\r\n   132\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(9)  VALUE \"DISCOUNT \".\r\n   133\t           05  LD-DISCOUNT           PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 BLANK WHEN ZERO.\r\n   134\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(5)  VALUE \"  VAT\".\r\n   135\t           05  LD-VAT                PIC ZZZ,ZZ9.99.\r\n   136\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(9)  VALUE \"  CURRENT\".\r\n   137\t           05  LD-CURRENT            PIC $$$,$$9.99.\r\n   138\t       01  L-ARR.\r\n   139\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"ARREARS \".\r\n   140\t           05  LX-ARREARS            PIC ++,+++,++9.99.\r\n   141\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE \"  INTEREST\".\r\n   142\t           05  LX-INTEREST           PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99 BLANK WHEN ZERO.\r\n   143\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(6)  VALUE \"  PAID\".\r\n   144\t           05  LX-PAID               PIC "]
[8.886987, "o", "ZZ,ZZ9.99.\r\n   145\t       01  L-BAL.\r\n   146\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"BALANCE \".\r\n   147\t           05  LL-BALANCE            PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99CR.\r\n   148\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(12) VALUE \"  AMOUNT DUE\".\r\n   149\t           05  LL-DUE                PIC ***,**9.99.\r\n   150\t       01  L-CARRY.\r\n   151\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(11) VALUE \"CREDIT C/F \".\r\n   152\t           05  LY-CARRY              PIC $$$,$$9.99-.\r\n   153\t       01  L-REJECT.\r\n   154\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(7)  VALUE \"REJECT \".\r\n   155\t           05  LJ-ACCT               PIC X(8).\r\n   156\t           05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   157\t           05  LJ-REASON             PIC X(20).\r\n   158\t       01  L-LEDGER.\r\n   159\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(24)\r\n   160\t                                     VALUE \"PAYMENTS AND ADJUSTMENTS\".\r\n   161\t       01  L-POST.\r\n   162\t           05  LP-KIND               PIC X(3).\r\n   163\t           0"]
[8.886991, "o", "5  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   164\t           05  LP-ACCT               PIC X(8).\r\n   165\t           05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   166\t           05  LP-AMT                PIC ----,--9.99.\r\n   167\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(7)  VALUE \" WHOLE \".\r\n   168\t           05  LP-WHOLE              PIC -----9.\r\n   169\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(5)  VALUE \" BAL \".\r\n   170\t           05  LP-BAL                PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99CR.\r\n   171\t           05  FILLER                PIC X     VALUE SPACE.\r\n   172\t           05  LP-MEMO               PIC X(30).\r\n   173\t       01  L-SPLIT.\r\n   174\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(16) VALUE \"    FEE SPLIT 3X\".\r\n   175\t           05  LS-PART               PIC ---,--9.99.\r\n   176\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(11) VALUE \" REMAINDER \".\r\n   177\t           05  LS-REM                PIC -9.99.\r\n   178\t       01  L-PAYREJ.\r\n   179\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(5)  VALUE \"LINE \".\r\n "]
[8.887059, "o", "  180\t           05  LQ-LINE               PIC ZZ9.\r\n   181\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE \" REJECTED \".\r\n   182\t           05  LQ-REASON             PIC X(20).\r\n   183\t       01  L-PAYTOT.\r\n   184\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"POSTED  \".\r\n   185\t           05  LV-APPLIED            PIC ZZ9.\r\n   186\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(11) VALUE \"  REJECTED \".\r\n   187\t           05  LV-REJECTED           PIC ZZ9.\r\n   188\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"  PAID  \".\r\n   189\t           05  LV-PAID               PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99-.\r\n   190\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(8)  VALUE \"  OTHER \".\r\n   191\t           05  LV-OTHER              PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99-.\r\n   192\t       01  L-TOT1.\r\n   193\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(16) VALUE \"ACCOUNTS BILLED \".\r\n   194\t           05  LT-BILLED             PIC ZZ9.\r\n   195\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(11) VALUE \"  REJECTED \".\r\n   196\t           05  LT-REJECTED       "]
[8.887064, "o", "    PIC ZZ9.\r\n   197\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE \"  CREDITS \".\r\n   198\t           05  LT-CREDITS            PIC ZZ9.\r\n   199\t       01  L-TOT2.\r\n   200\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(12) VALUE \"TOTAL UNITS \".\r\n   201\t           05  LT-UNITS              PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.\r\n   202\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(16) VALUE \"  TOTAL CURRENT \".\r\n   203\t           05  LT-CURRENT            PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.\r\n   204\t       01  L-TOT3.\r\n   205\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(10) VALUE \"TOTAL DUE \".\r\n   206\t           05  LT-DUE                PIC $$$,$$$,$$9.99.\r\n   207\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(15) VALUE \"  AVERAGE BILL \".\r\n   208\t           05  LT-AVERAGE            PIC $$,$$$,$$9.99.\r\n   209\t       01  L-TOT4.\r\n   210\t           05  FILLER                PIC X(13) VALUE \"NET POSITION \".\r\n   211\t           05  LT-NET                PIC ---,---,--9.99.\r\n   212\t       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\r\n   213\t       MAIN-LINE.\r\n   214\t           OPEN INPU"]
[8.887067, "o", "T CUST-IN\r\n   215\t                OUTPUT STMT-OUT\r\n   216\t           PERFORM READ-IN\r\n   217\t           IF NOT END-OF-INPUT AND IS-HEADER\r\n   218\t               PERFORM WRITE-HEADER\r\n   219\t               PERFORM READ-IN\r\n   220\t           END-IF\r\n   221\t           PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-INPUT\r\n   222\t               IF IS-CUSTOMER\r\n   223\t                   PERFORM ONE-ACCOUNT\r\n   224\t               END-IF\r\n   225\t               PERFORM READ-IN\r\n   226\t           END-PERFORM\r\n   227\t           PERFORM WRITE-TOTALS\r\n   228\t           PERFORM POST-PAYMENTS\r\n   229\t           CLOSE CUST-IN STMT-OUT\r\n   230\t           STOP RUN.\r\n   231\t\r\n   232\t       READ-IN.\r\n   233\t           READ CUST-IN INTO CUST-REC\r\n   234\t               AT END SET END-OF-INPUT TO TRUE\r\n   235\t           END-READ.\r\n   236\t\r\n   237\t       WRITE-HEADER.\r\n   238\t           MOVE HDR-REGION TO LH-REGION\r\n   239\t           MOVE STMT-DATE(7:2) TO WS-DATE-DMY(1:2)\r\n   240\t           MOVE STMT-DATE(5:2) TO WS-DATE-DMY(3:2)\r\n   241\t           MOVE STM"]
[8.88707, "o", "T-DATE(1:4) TO WS-DATE-DMY(5:4)\r\n   242\t           MOVE WS-DATE-DMY TO LH-DATE\r\n   243\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-HEAD\r\n   244\t           MOVE SPACES TO OUT-REC\r\n   245\t           WRITE OUT-REC.\r\n   246\t\r\n   247\t       ONE-ACCOUNT.\r\n   248\t           MOVE SPACES TO WS-REASON\r\n   249\t           SET TX TO 1\r\n   250\t           SEARCH TARIFF-ROW\r\n   251\t               AT END MOVE \"UNKNOWN TARIFF\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   252\t               WHEN TR-CODE(TX) = TARIFF\r\n   253\t                   CONTINUE\r\n   254\t           END-SEARCH\r\n   255\t           EVALUATE TRUE\r\n   256\t               WHEN WS-REASON NOT = SPACES\r\n   257\t                   CONTINUE\r\n   258\t               WHEN BILL-DAYS = 0\r\n   259\t                   MOVE \"NO BILLING DAYS\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   260\t               WHEN BILL-DAYS > 120\r\n   261\t                   MOVE \"PERIOD TOO LONG\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   262\t           END-EVALUATE\r\n   263\t           IF WS-REASON NOT = SPACES\r\n   264\t               ADD 1 TO WS-REJECTED\r\n   265\t               MOVE ACCT-NO TO LJ-"]
[8.887076, "o", "ACCT\r\n   266\t               MOVE WS-REASON TO LJ-REASON\r\n   267\t               WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-REJECT\r\n   268\t               MOVE SPACES TO OUT-REC\r\n   269\t               WRITE OUT-REC\r\n   270\t           ELSE\r\n   271\t               PERFORM CALC-BILL\r\n   272\t               PERFORM PRINT-BILL\r\n   273\t           END-IF.\r\n   274\t\r\n   275\t       CALC-BILL.\r\n   276\t           IF CURR-READ >= PREV-READ\r\n   277\t               SUBTRACT PREV-READ FROM CURR-READ GIVING WS-UNITS"]
[8.888245, "o", "\r\n   278\t           ELSE\r\n   279\t               COMPUTE WS-UNITS = CURR-READ + 1000000 - PREV-READ\r\n   280\t           END-IF\r\n   281\t           MULTIPLY TR-LIMIT1(TX) BY BILL-DAYS GIVING WS-TEMP\r\n   282\t           DIVIDE WS-TEMP BY 30 GIVING WS-LIM1 ROUNDED\r\n   283\t           MULTIPLY TR-LIMIT2(TX) BY BILL-DAYS GIVING WS-TEMP\r\n   284\t           DIVIDE WS-TEMP BY 30 GIVING WS-LIM2 ROUNDED\r\n   285\t           MOVE 0 TO WS-B1 WS-B2 WS-B3\r\n   286\t           IF WS-UNITS > WS-LIM1\r\n   287\t               MOVE WS-LIM1 TO WS-B1\r\n   288\t               IF WS-UNITS > WS-LIM2\r\n   289\t                   SUBTRACT WS-LIM1 FROM WS-LIM2 GIVING WS-B2\r\n   290\t                   SUBTRACT WS-LIM2 FROM WS-UNITS GIVING WS-B3\r\n   291\t               ELSE\r\n   292\t                   SUBTRACT WS-LIM1 FROM WS-UNITS GIVING WS-B2\r\n   293\t               END-IF\r\n   294\t           ELSE\r\n   295\t               MOVE WS-UNITS TO WS-B1\r\n   296\t           END-IF\r\n   297\t           MULTIPLY WS-B1 BY TR-RATE1(TX) GIVING WS-C1 ROUNDED\r\n   298\t          "]
[8.888289, "o", " MULTIPLY WS-B2 BY TR-RATE2(TX) GIVING WS-C2 ROUNDED\r\n   299\t           MULTIPLY WS-B3 BY TR-RATE3(TX) GIVING WS-C3 ROUNDED\r\n   300\t           ADD WS-C1 WS-C2 WS-C3 GIVING WS-USAGE\r\n   301\t           MULTIPLY BILL-DAYS BY TR-STANDING(TX)\r\n   302\t               GIVING WS-STANDING ROUNDED\r\n   303\t           MOVE 0 TO WS-DISCOUNT\r\n   304\t           IF TARIFF-RELIEF\r\n   305\t               MULTIPLY WS-USAGE BY 0.15 GIVING WS-DISCOUNT\r\n   306\t               SUBTRACT WS-DISCOUNT FROM WS-USAGE\r\n   307\t           END-IF\r\n   308\t           ADD WS-USAGE WS-STANDING GIVING WS-NET\r\n   309\t           MULTIPLY WS-NET BY 0.05 GIVING WS-VAT ROUNDED\r\n   310\t           ADD WS-NET WS-VAT GIVING WS-CURRENT\r\n   311\t           MOVE 0 TO WS-INTEREST\r\n   312\t           IF ARREARS > 0\r\n   313\t               MULTIPLY ARREARS BY 0.015 GIVING WS-INTEREST ROUNDED\r\n   314\t           END-IF\r\n   315\t           COMPUTE WS-BALANCE = WS-CURRENT + ARREARS + WS-INTEREST\r\n   316\t                              - PAID\r\n   317\t           MOVE 0 TO WS-"]
[8.888298, "o", "DUE WS-CARRY\r\n   318\t           IF WS-BALANCE > 0\r\n   319\t               MOVE WS-BALANCE TO WS-DUE\r\n   320\t           END-IF\r\n   321\t           IF WS-BALANCE < 0\r\n   322\t               MULTIPLY WS-BALANCE BY 0.975 GIVING WS-CARRY ROUNDED\r\n   323\t               ADD 1 TO WS-CREDITS\r\n   324\t           END-IF\r\n   325\t           ADD 1 TO WS-BILLED\r\n   326\t           ADD 1 TO AT-COUNT\r\n   327\t           MOVE ACCT-NO TO AT-ACCT(AT-COUNT)\r\n   328\t           MOVE WS-BALANCE TO AT-BAL(AT-COUNT)\r\n   329\t           ADD WS-UNITS TO WS-TOT-UNITS\r\n   330\t           ADD WS-CURRENT TO WS-TOT-CURRENT\r\n   331\t           ADD WS-DUE TO WS-TOT-DUE\r\n   332\t           ADD WS-BALANCE TO WS-TOT-NET.\r\n   333\t\r\n   334\t       PRINT-BILL.\r\n   335\t           MOVE CUST-NAME TO WS-NAME\r\n   336\t           INSPECT WS-NAME CONVERTING \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\"\r\n   337\t                                   TO \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\"\r\n   338\t           MOVE SPACES TO WS-NAME-OUT\r\n   339\t           STRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY \"  \" INTO WS-NAME"]
[8.888306, "o", "-OUT\r\n   340\t           IF WS-NAME-OUT = SPACES\r\n   341\t               MOVE \"(NO NAME ON FILE)\" TO WS-NAME-OUT\r\n   342\t           END-IF\r\n   343\t           MOVE ACCT-NO(5:4) TO LA-TAIL\r\n   344\t           MOVE WS-NAME-OUT TO LA-NAME\r\n   345\t           MOVE TARIFF TO LA-TARIFF\r\n   346\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-ACCT\r\n   347\t           MOVE PREV-READ TO LR-PREV\r\n   348\t           MOVE CURR-READ TO LR-CURR\r\n   349\t           MOVE WS-UNITS TO LR-UNITS\r\n   350\t           MOVE BILL-DAYS TO LR-DAYS\r\n   351\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-READ\r\n   352\t           MOVE WS-B1 TO LB-1\r\n   353\t           MOVE WS-B2 TO LB-2\r\n   354\t           MOVE WS-B3 TO LB-3\r\n   355\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-BANDS\r\n   356\t           MOVE WS-USAGE TO LC-USAGE\r\n   357\t           MOVE WS-STANDING TO LC-STANDING\r\n   358\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-CHARGE\r\n   359\t           MOVE WS-DISCOUNT TO LD-DISCOUNT\r\n   360\t           MOVE WS-VAT TO LD-VAT\r\n   361\t           MOVE WS-CURRENT TO LD-CURRENT\r\n   362\t           WRITE OUT-REC F"]
[8.888314, "o", "ROM L-DISC\r\n   363\t           MOVE ARREARS TO LX-ARREARS\r\n   364\t           MOVE WS-INTEREST TO LX-INTEREST\r\n   365\t           MOVE PAID TO LX-PAID\r\n   366\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-ARR\r\n   367\t           MOVE WS-BALANCE TO LL-BALANCE\r\n   368\t           MOVE WS-DUE TO LL-DUE\r\n   369\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-BAL\r\n   370\t           IF WS-BALANCE < 0\r\n   371\t               MOVE WS-CARRY TO LY-CARRY\r\n   372\t               WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-CARRY\r\n   373\t           END-IF\r\n   374\t           MOVE SPACES TO OUT-REC\r\n   375\t           WRITE OUT-REC.\r\n   376\t\r\n   377\t       WRITE-TOTALS.\r\n   378\t           MOVE WS-BILLED TO LT-BILLED\r\n   379\t           MOVE WS-REJECTED TO LT-REJECTED\r\n   380\t           MOVE WS-CREDITS TO LT-CREDITS\r\n   381\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-TOT1\r\n   382\t           MOVE WS-TOT-UNITS TO LT-UNITS\r\n   383\t           MOVE WS-TOT-CURRENT TO LT-CURRENT\r\n   384\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-TOT2\r\n   385\t           IF WS-BILLED > 0\r\n   386\t               DIVIDE WS-TOT-CURRENT B"]
[8.888588, "o", "Y WS-BILLED\r\n   387\t                   GIVING WS-AVERAGE ROUNDED\r\n   388\t           END-IF\r\n   389\t           MOVE WS-TOT-DUE TO LT-DUE\r\n   390\t           MOVE WS-AVERAGE TO LT-AVERAGE\r\n   391\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-TOT3\r\n   392\t           MOVE WS-TOT-NET TO LT-NET\r\n   393\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-TOT4.\r\n   394\t\r\n   395\t       POST-PAYMENTS.\r\n   396\t           MOVE SPACES TO OUT-REC\r\n   397\t           WRITE OUT-REC\r\n   398\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-LEDGER\r\n   399\t           OPEN INPUT PAY-IN\r\n   400\t           PERFORM READ-PAY\r\n   401\t           PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-PAY\r\n   402\t               ADD 1 TO WS-LINE-NO\r\n   403\t               PERFORM ONE-PAYMENT\r\n   404\t               PERFORM READ-PAY\r\n   405\t           END-PERFORM\r\n   406\t           CLOSE PAY-IN\r\n   407\t           MOVE WS-APPLIED TO LV-APPLIED\r\n   408\t           MOVE WS-PAY-REJECTED TO LV-REJECTED\r\n   409\t           MOVE WS-TOT-PAID TO LV-PAID\r\n   410\t           MOVE WS-TOT-OTHER TO LV-OTHER\r\n   411\t           WRITE OUT-REC FRO"]
[8.888704, "o", "M L-PAYTOT.\r\n   412\t\r\n   413\t       READ-PAY.\r\n   414\t           READ PAY-IN INTO PAY-LINE\r\n   415\t               AT END SET END-OF-PAY TO TRUE\r\n   416\t           END-READ.\r\n   417\t\r\n   418\t       ONE-PAYMENT.\r\n   419\t           MOVE 0 TO PL-FIELDS PL-ACCT-LEN\r\n   420\t           UNSTRING PAY-LINE DELIMITED BY \";\"\r\n   421\t               INTO PL-ACCT COUNT IN PL-ACCT-LEN\r\n   422\t                    PL-KIND\r\n   423\t                    PL-AMT-TXT\r\n   424\t                    PL-MEMO\r\n   425\t               TALLYING IN PL-FIELDS\r\n   426\t           END-UNSTRING\r\n   427\t           MOVE SPACES TO WS-REASON\r\n   428\t           EVALUATE TRUE\r\n   429\t               WHEN PL-FIELDS < 3\r\n   430\t                   MOVE \"TOO FEW FIELDS\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   431\t               WHEN PL-ACCT-LEN NOT = 8\r\n   432\t                   MOVE \"BAD ACCOUNT\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   433\t               WHEN FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(PL-AMT-TXT) NOT = 0\r\n   434\t                   MOVE \"BAD AMOUNT\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   435\t               WHEN NOT (KIND-PAY OR KIND"]
[8.888733, "o", "-ADJ OR KIND-FEE OR KIND-REF)\r\n   436\t                   MOVE \"BAD KIND\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   437\t           END-EVALUATE\r\n   438\t           IF WS-REASON = SPACES\r\n   439\t               SET AX TO 1\r\n   440\t               SEARCH AT-ENTRY\r\n   441\t                   AT END MOVE \"NO SUCH ACCOUNT\" TO WS-REASON\r\n   442\t                   WHEN AT-ACCT(AX) = PL-ACCT\r\n   443\t                       CONTINUE\r\n   444\t               END-SEARCH\r\n   445\t           END-IF\r\n   446\t           IF WS-REASON NOT = SPACES\r\n   447\t               ADD 1 TO WS-PAY-REJECTED\r\n   448\t               MOVE WS-LINE-NO TO LQ-LINE\r\n   449\t               MOVE WS-REASON TO LQ-REASON\r\n   450\t               WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-PAYREJ\r\n   451\t           ELSE\r\n   452\t               PERFORM APPLY-PAYMENT\r\n   453\t           END-IF.\r\n   454\t\r\n   455\t       APPLY-PAYMENT.\r\n   456\t           EVALUATE TRUE\r\n   457\t               WHEN KIND-PAY\r\n   458\t                   COMPUTE WS-AMT ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-EVEN\r\n   459\t                       = FUNCTION NUMVAL("]
[8.88875, "o", "PL-AMT-TXT)\r\n   460\t                   SUBTRACT WS-AMT FROM AT-BAL(AX)\r\n   461\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-PAID\r\n   462\t               WHEN KIND-ADJ\r\n   463\t                   COMPUTE WS-AMT ROUNDED\r\n   464\t                       = FUNCTION NUMVAL(PL-AMT-TXT)\r\n   465\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO AT-BAL(AX)\r\n   466\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-OTHER\r\n   467\t               WHEN KIND-FEE\r\n   468\t                   COMPUTE WS-AMT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(PL-AMT-TXT)\r\n   469\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO AT-BAL(AX)\r\n   470\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-OTHER\r\n   471\t                   DIVIDE WS-AMT BY 3 GIVING WS-PART ROUNDED\r\n   472\t                       REMAINDER WS-REM\r\n   473\t               WHEN KIND-REF\r\n   474\t                   COMPUTE WS-AMT ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-LESSER\r\n   475\t                       = FUNCTION NUMVAL(PL-AMT-TXT)\r\n   476\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO AT-BAL(AX)\r\n   477\t                   ADD WS-AMT TO WS-TOT-OTHER\r\n   478\t           END-EVALUATE\r\n   479\t "]
[8.888816, "o", "          COMPUTE WS-WHOLE = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-AMT)\r\n   480\t           INSPECT PL-MEMO CONVERTING \"0123456789\" TO \"XXXXXXXXXX\"\r\n   481\t               AFTER INITIAL \"#\"\r\n   482\t           ADD 1 TO WS-APPLIED\r\n   483\t           MOVE PL-KIND TO LP-KIND\r\n   484\t           MOVE PL-ACCT TO LP-ACCT\r\n   485\t           MOVE WS-AMT TO LP-AMT\r\n   486\t           MOVE WS-WHOLE TO LP-WHOLE\r\n   487\t           MOVE AT-BAL(AX) TO LP-BAL\r\n   488\t           MOVE PL-MEMO TO LP-MEMO\r\n   489\t           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-POST\r\n   490\t           IF KIND-FEE\r\n   491\t               MOVE WS-PART TO LS-PART\r\n   492\t               MOVE WS-REM TO LS-REM\r\n   493\t               WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-SPLIT\r\n   494\t           END-IF.\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@1a267ab558a6:/app# "]
